flowchart LR
    Data[Training and serving data] --> Store[S3, FSx, EFS, OpenZFS]
    Store --> Train[Training or fine-tuning]
    Train --> Artifact[Model and checkpoint]
    Artifact --> Cache[Node or local model cache]
    Cache --> Serve[CPU, GPU, Inferentia, or Trainium inference]
    Serve --> Metrics[Latency, tokens, utilization, memory, power]
    Metrics --> Scale[Pod and accelerator scaling]
    Scale --> Serve
